= Jacob D. Cox

Jacob D. Cox of Ohio is a respected Union general, lawyer, and reform-minded statesman. Throughout his career, Cox has championed honest government, merit-based appointments, and efficient public administration. A leading <span style="color: #DAA520;">**Liberal Republican**</span>, he believes lasting national unity depends upon integrity in government rather than political patronage.

